**
!dist/**
!package.json
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!media/icon.png
!media/preview.css
!media/preview.js
!media/screenshots/*.jpg
# The renderer library and its dependencies, installed by vsce from the production tree
# (ADR 0010). Only files provably unused at runtime are left out: type declarations, source
# maps, and the elkjs builds the renderer never loads — it requires `lib/elk.bundled.js`, which
# is self-contained, so `elk-worker.js`, `elk-worker.min.js` and `main.js` stay out (`elk-api.js`
# is kept: it is small, and the typings name it). The packaged-VSIX host test is the guard. vsce
# lets any negation win over any ignore, so the trim is written into the negations themselves.
!node_modules/!(elkjs)/**/!(*.d.ts|*.map)
!node_modules/elkjs/{package.json,LICENSE.md,README.md}
!node_modules/elkjs/lib/{elk.bundled.js,elk-api.js}
